    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53273",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COUNTESS.\nDo you cry ‘O Lord, sir!’ at your whipping, and ‘spare not me’? Indeed your ‘O Lord, sir!’ is very sequent to your whipping. You would answer very well to a whipping, if you were but bound to’t.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53273/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53273/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 204,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 178388,
        "end": 178624,
        "line": 5021,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@53273",
        "anchor": "sceneII_2.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COUNTESS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53513",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOWN.\nI ne’er had worse luck in my life in my ‘O Lord, sir!’ I see things may serve long, but not serve ever.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53513/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53513/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 110,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 178628,
        "end": 178769,
        "line": 5028,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap02/p@53513",
        "anchor": "sceneII_2.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOWN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53658",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COUNTESS.\nI play the noble housewife with the time, to entertain it so merrily with a fool.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneII_2.2/p@53658/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
