      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COUNTESS.\nAn end, sir! To your business. Give Helen this,\nAnd urge her to a present answer back.\nCommend me to my kinsmen and my son.\nThis is not much.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
